{"id":"space-agents-05x.2.1","title":"OBJ-001: Update /pod skill for Beads task operations","description":"Replace SQLite queries in skills/pod/skill.md with Beads CLI.\n\nChanges:\n- SELECT objective details → bd show \u003ctask_id\u003e --json\n- UPDATE status = 'in_progress' → bd update \u003ctask_id\u003e --status in_progress\n- UPDATE status = 'complete' → bd close \u003ctask_id\u003e --reason \"...\"\n- UPDATE failed + INSERT alert → create blocking bug via bd create -t bug\n\nTerminology: mission→feature, objective→task, alert→bug\n\nSuccess: No SQLite references remain. Pod loads/updates/closes tasks via bd.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"fraserbrown@live.com","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:05.036802+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject","updated_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:05.036802+11:00","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"space-agents-05x.2.1","depends_on_id":"space-agents-05x.2","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:05.038004+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject"}]}
{"id":"space-agents-05x.2.2","title":"OBJ-002: Update /airlock to create blocking bugs","description":"Replace alert creation in skills/airlock/SKILL.md with Beads bug creation + blocking dependency.\n\nWhen airlock fails:\n1. bd create \"Bug: Tests failed - $SUMMARY\" -t bug --parent $FEATURE_ID -p 0 --label severity:blocker\n2. bd dep add $TASK_ID $BUG_ID (block the failed task)\n3. bd sync\n\nResult: bd ready returns the BUG, not the blocked task. Ralph picks up bug first.\n\nSuccess: Airlock creates blocking bugs. Blocked tasks hidden from bd ready.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"fraserbrown@live.com","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:05.826882+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject","updated_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:05.826882+11:00","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"space-agents-05x.2.2","depends_on_id":"space-agents-05x.2","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:05.82783+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject"},{"issue_id":"space-agents-05x.2.2","depends_on_id":"space-agents-05x.2.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:18.085969+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject"}]}
{"id":"space-agents-05x.2.3","title":"OBJ-003: Update /capcom for Beads queries","description":"Replace SQL status queries in skills/capcom/skill.md with Beads CLI.\n\nChanges:\n- SELECT missions → bd list -t feature --json\n- SELECT objectives → bd list -t task --json  \n- SELECT alerts → bd list -t bug --status open --json\n- Blocked tasks → bd blocked\n- Statistics → bd stats\n\nSuccess: CAPCOM shows accurate status from Beads. No SQLite references.","status":"open","priority":3,"issue_type":"task","owner":"fraserbrown@live.com","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:06.470431+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject","updated_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:06.470431+11:00","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"space-agents-05x.2.3","depends_on_id":"space-agents-05x.2","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:06.471403+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject"},{"issue_id":"space-agents-05x.2.3","depends_on_id":"space-agents-05x.2.2","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:18.199264+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject"}]}
{"id":"space-agents-05x.2.4","title":"OBJ-004: Update /handover for Beads context generation","description":"Replace SQL queries in skills/handover/skill.md with Beads CLI for context handover.\n\nContext generation:\n- Active epic → bd list -t epic --status open\n- Dependency tree → bd dep tree \u003cepic_id\u003e\n- Next tasks → bd ready --json | head\n- Open bugs → bd list -t bug --status open\n\nSuccess: Handover captures complete Beads state with dependency tree.","status":"open","priority":4,"issue_type":"task","owner":"fraserbrown@live.com","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:07.045728+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject","updated_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:07.045728+11:00","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"space-agents-05x.2.4","depends_on_id":"space-agents-05x.2","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:07.046604+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject"},{"issue_id":"space-agents-05x.2.4","depends_on_id":"space-agents-05x.2.3","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-01-21T20:29:18.308981+11:00","created_by":"thebrownproject"}]}
